<p><em>And I'm not afraid.</em></p>
<p><em>I don't care what's out there. I'm not afraid. I won't let this thing tell me what to do.</em></p>
<p><em>&#8230;There's one way out that we didn't talk about, Mimi. We didn't want to think about it at the time, but&#8230;we're running out of time. Even now, I can still feel the urges, but&#8230;for now, I'm still here.</em></p>
<p><em>SCP-5975 doesn't work on one case, and one case only.</em></p>
<p><em>The characters can't kill each other if one of them's already dead.</em></p>
<p><em>I'm so, so sorry.</em></p>
<p><em>I love you.</em></p>
</blockquote>
